{"id":"a259bccc4d92ed15","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal7 Null Cover Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Null Cover Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Null Cover Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal — ZFC Ideal7 Null Cover Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\)</span> (measure-space candidate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (ideal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7NullCoverIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7NullCoverIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}null\\text{-}cover\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7NullCoverIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists N\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}null\\text{-}cover\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7NullCoverIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists N\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the ideal of all subsets of measurable null sets, whether or not the original measure space is complete; no unrelated topological-cover or ring-ideal predicate is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)$ (measure-space candidate; see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7NullCoverIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal7\\text{-}null\\text{-}cover\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal7NullCoverIdeal}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists N\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1118,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal.md|58-df-zfc-ideal7-null-cover-ideal]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}